264	**2. Deterministic pre-gate before spending LLM tokens — `scripts/quality-gate-runner.js`**
265	A plain `execSync` step runs a project-detected or user-declared command (`.zeroshot-quality` file → project-config → auto-pass) and only on success does the pipeline proceed to publish `QUALITY_GATE_PASSED`, which is what unblocks the (expensive) LLM validators. On failure it re-flags a heuristically-detected command as `heuristic-failed` so re-detection is retried next run — self-healing without a human editing config.
